  (
    'data-scientist',
    'Data Scientist',
    'Data and Analytics',
    'Data Scientists turn raw data into decisions, forecasts and measurable business insight.',
    $career$<h2>What does a Data Scientist do?</h2><p>A Data Scientist combines statistics, business understanding and programming to answer important questions with data. In 2026, this remains one of the most searched career paths because almost every sector now needs evidence-based decisions.</p><h2>Best-fit students</h2><p>This path fits students who like numbers, patterns, dashboards and asking why something is happening. Common routes include <a href="/courses/btech">B.Tech</a>, <a href="/courses/bca">BCA</a>, <a href="/courses/mca">MCA</a>, <a href="/courses/msc">M.Sc</a>, economics, statistics and analytics programmes.</p><h2>Skills to build first</h2><p>Learn SQL, Python, statistics, Excel, data cleaning, visualisation, experimentation and storytelling. A good portfolio should include end-to-end projects with a clear question, method and conclusion.</p><h2>Career outlook</h2><p>Hiring is strong in fintech, ecommerce, SaaS, consulting, healthcare, telecom and consumer internet. Early roles include data analyst, business analyst, decision scientist and junior data scientist.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>Is coding compulsory?</h3><p>Yes, at least SQL and Python are important for serious data roles.</p><h3>Can commerce students enter data science?</h3><p>Yes. Commerce students with statistics, analytics and finance context can become strong business-facing data professionals.</p>$career$,
    'Data Scientist is a strong career for students who like statistics, SQL, Python and business problem solving. It connects well with technology, commerce, economics and management routes.',
    '₹6 - 30 LPA',
    'Very High',
    '0 - 2 years for analyst roles; 2+ years for data scientist roles',
    ARRAY['SQL','Python','Statistics','Power BI','Machine Learning','Data Storytelling','Experimentation'],
    ARRAY['Google','Amazon','Flipkart','Zomato','Deloitte','Mu Sigma','Fractal','Accenture'],
    ARRAY['btech','bca','mca','msc','mba','bcom'],
    ARRAY['cuet','gate','cat'],
    '[{"title":"Data Analyst","level":"Entry"},{"title":"Business Analyst","level":"Entry"},{"title":"Data Scientist","level":"Mid"},{"title":"Decision Scientist","level":"Mid"}]'::jsonb,
    '📊',
    'Data Scientist Career Scope 2026 - Salary, Skills and Courses',
    'Explore Data Scientist career scope, salary, skills, courses, exams and top hiring sectors for Indian students.',
    'data scientist career, data analyst, analytics jobs, data science salary India',
