    '🛡️',
    'Cybersecurity Analyst Career Scope 2026',
    'Explore Cybersecurity Analyst salary, skills, courses, exams, job roles and career path in India.',
    'cybersecurity analyst, ethical hacking career, SOC analyst, cyber security jobs India',
    true,
