  (
    'renewable-energy-engineer',
    'Renewable Energy Engineer',
    'Clean Energy',
    'Renewable Energy Engineers design and support solar, wind, storage and clean power systems.',
    $career$<h2>What does a Renewable Energy Engineer do?</h2><p>A Renewable Energy Engineer works on solar plants, wind systems, battery storage, energy audits and clean power integration. The career is gaining attention because India is expanding clean energy capacity and companies are tracking sustainability goals.</p><h2>Best-fit students</h2><p>This path suits students who like electrical systems, mechanical systems, environment and field problem solving. Useful routes include <a href="/courses/btech">B.Tech</a> in electrical, mechanical, energy or related engineering branches.</p><h2>Skills to build first</h2><p>Learn electrical basics, solar PV design, power systems, AutoCAD, energy auditing, project management and safety standards. Field internships help a lot.</p><h2>Career outlook</h2><p>Roles exist with renewable developers, EPC companies, consulting firms, utilities and manufacturing companies. Entry roles include solar design engineer, project engineer, energy analyst and O&M engineer.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>Is renewable energy a stable career?</h3><p>It is promising, especially for students who combine engineering basics with project and field exposure.</p><h3>Do I need coding?</h3><p>Not always, but data analysis and simulation tools can improve opportunities.</p>$career$,
    'Renewable Energy Engineer is a clean-energy career for students interested in solar, wind, battery storage and power systems. Build engineering fundamentals and field exposure.',
    '₹4 - 18 LPA',
    'High',
    '0 - 2 years for design, project and O&M roles',
    ARRAY['Solar PV Design','Power Systems','AutoCAD','Energy Audits','Project Management','Safety Standards','Data Analysis'],
    ARRAY['Tata Power Solar','ReNew','Adani Green','L&T','Suzlon','NTPC Renewable Energy'],
    ARRAY['btech','master-of-technology-mtech'],
    ARRAY['jee-main','gate'],
    '[{"title":"Solar Design Engineer","level":"Entry"},{"title":"Renewable Project Engineer","level":"Entry"},{"title":"Energy Analyst","level":"Entry"},{"title":"O&M Engineer","level":"Entry to Mid"}]'::jsonb,
    '🌱',
    'Renewable Energy Engineer Career Scope 2026',
    'Explore Renewable Energy Engineer salary, skills, courses and job roles for Indian students.',
    'renewable energy career, solar engineer, clean energy jobs India, power systems career',
    true,
    12
  ),
